
### get all Events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/event


### get one Event
GET http://localhost:3000/api/event/1

### create a new Event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/event
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-09-05",
  "startTime": "10:30",
  "endTime": "18:00",
  "coverImage": "festival.jpg",
  "description": "Festival de música y arte",
  "status": "disponible"
}

### update an Event (PUT - full, idempotent resource)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/event/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-08-13",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "17:00",
  "id": "8a7c3e91-5f24-4b68-9d13-2e7a6c4f0b52",
  "coverImage": "imagen.jpg",
  "description": "Exposicion rural",
  "status": "disponible"
}

### update an Event (PATCH - partial resource)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/event/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coverImage": "tractor.jpg"
}

### delete an Event
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/event/1